<title>JAPAN: Japan August lead imports soar 68.4 pct year/year.</title>
<headline>Japan August lead imports soar 68.4 pct year/year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined lead imports in August totalled 2,166 tonnes, up 68.4 percent from 1,286 tonnes in the same month a year earlier, Finance Ministry data issued on Monday showed.</p>
<p>The breakdown is as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		  August 96	  July 96	 August 95</p>
<p> Total	    2,166	     2,565	    1,286</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> China	    1,029	     1,359		100</p>
<p> Peru		 415		 267		412</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in the first eight months of 1996 were 27,023 tonnes against 68,725 tonnes during the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodities Desk (813 3432 6179)</p>
</text>
